		{"id":"f829a1c42a6fa379","x":111,"y":-295,"width":809,"height":215,"type":"text","text":"You go upstairs to your tooms. After everything that happened today you manage to fall fast asleep. You get some strange dreams.\n- About a scholar teaching a young prince the ways to lead a kingdom\n- You dream about a young man getting lost on a battlefield\n- You dream about two kids stealing food from the streets\n- And about a man and a woman teaching their daughter how to wield a bow \n"},
